---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/main.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="The privacy policy for icebenitez.com, outlining how visitor data and contact information is handled."
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:py-20">
    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="space-y-3">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <strong class="text-foreground">Effective Date:</strong> April 22, 2025
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-6 leading-7 text-muted-foreground [&_strong]:text-foreground [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_p]:mt-4 [&_ul]:mt-4 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-2 [&_ul]:pl-6">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy describes how personal information is collected and
          used when you visit or interact with <strong>icebenitez.com</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information Collected</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Technical Information:</strong> Cloudflare Web Analytics may
            collect anonymized traffic and performance data when you visit the
            site.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How Information is Used</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            To monitor site performance and improve the user experience using
            analytics tools.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>This site uses the following third-party services:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare Pages:</strong> Hosts the static content of the
            website. Cloudflare may process IP addresses and technical metadata
            for security and operations.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics:</strong> Collects anonymized traffic
            and performance data.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These services may collect anonymized or technical data in accordance
          with their own privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          Technical measures are in place to protect the site and the limited
          technical information processed by its hosting and analytics providers.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may contact the site owner with questions about data handled by
          third-party services used to operate this website.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this policy, please reach out through the
          contact details available on the site owner&rsquo;s public profiles.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
